{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Doll Museum!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Valentine: the cutest chaos queen with enough slay for two!</strong>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/ad2d557395aa4cb82ce5f3b2070333a3.poster.avif?t=1773393184\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/ad2d557395aa4cb82ce5f3b2070333a3.webm?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/ad2d557395aa4cb82ce5f3b2070333a3.mp4?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valentine was turned into a collectible by the Doll Queen, a cruel ruler who delights in trapping lost souls and transforming them into dolls to decorate her museum of misery. As Valentine\u2019s bestie\u00a0<strong>you guide her choices</strong>, helping her navigate eerie pink halls, confront creepy dolls and resist the Queen\u2019s psychological traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The museum tests Valentine\u2019s confidence, identity and will to fight back!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken as a doll in a kawaii nightmare!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/28111ed5f908e8ea14069dbd09547b4c.avif?t=1773393184\" width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped in a doll museum that hides far more horror than beauty. What looks pastel and cute on the surface is actually a nightmare stitched together from sadness, self-hate and sorrow. To escape, you must survive the museum\u2019s horrors, uncover the truth behind your imprisonment and outplay the Doll Queen\u2019s twisted game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Secrets Behind the Doll\u2019s Smile</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually, you\u2019ll uncover Valentine\u2019s dark past and childhood traumas. Each exhibit holds secrets that will enchant you while also frightening you. Some dolls play their own nasty games, while others support you in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.poster.avif?t=1773393184\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.webm?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.mp4?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, run, slay!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll explore beautiful Japanese-inspired rooms full of kawaii details. Interact with dolls, objects, and hidden secrets, and shape Valentine\u2019s fate through dialogues and choices. Avoid dangerous dolls or confront them\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/799750f48eddcfa0363c3edaea319665.poster.avif?t=1773393184\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/799750f48eddcfa0363c3edaea319665.webm?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/799750f48eddcfa0363c3edaea319665.mp4?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Skins for every Mood!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize Valentine\u2019s outfits and accessories and discover all the hidden cats in the museum to unlock rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/c93110f0f2e077ba6d5a145f6e2ddbea.avif?t=1773393184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras_big/c93110f0f2e077ba6d5a145f6e2ddbea.webp?t=1773393184 width=1560 height=681 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to shake up the museum?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love cuteness mixed with a psychological Horror story, you\u2019ll adore the doll museum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.poster.avif?t=1773393184\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.webm?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.mp4?t=1773393184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive story game with cute, unforgettable characters<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend of psychological horror and cute aesthetics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious, hand-drawn rooms with Japanese-inspired Kawaii Style!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1773393184\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny tarot readings with a sassy fortune teller<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\